{"id":"sand-crystal","name":{"en":"Sand Crystal","ja":"砂晶石","tc":"砂晶石","sc":"砂晶石"},"desc1":{"en":"It's sand, but if you look really closely, there's little shiny crystals.","ja":"「砂…なんだけど、よーく見ると中にキラキラ　した結晶が混じってるんだよね」","tc":"「這個……雖然是砂子，但仔細一看　裡面混著亮晶晶的結晶呢。」","sc":"“这个……虽然是砂子，但仔细一看　里面混着亮晶晶的结晶呢。”"},"desc2":{"en":"Yeah. It's nothing but small crystals, but it's beautiful to look at.","ja":"「ええ。細かい結晶しかないけど…　観賞用としてはなかなか素敵だわ」","tc":"「是啊，雖然都是很細小的結晶……　但拿來觀賞還挺棒的呢。」","sc":"“是啊，虽然都是很细小的结晶……　但拿来观赏还挺棒的呢。”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","level":11,"categories":[{"id":"ore","name":{"en":"(Ore)","ja":"（鉱石）","tc":"（礦石）","sc":"（矿石）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-ore"},{"id":"sand","name":{"en":"(Sand)","ja":"（砂）","tc":"（砂）","sc":"（砂）"},"icon":"firis-category-sand"}],"locations":[{"id":"light-lake","name":{"en":"Light Lake","ja":"淡色の水海","tc":"淡色水海","sc":"淡色水海"}},{"id":"southern-plains","name":{"en":"Southern Plains","ja":"南方原野","tc":"南方原野","sc":"南方原野"}},{"id":"quiet-forest","name":{"en":"Quiet Forest","ja":"静かの森","tc":"寧靜之森","sc":"宁静之森"}},{"id":"ertona-underground-lake","name":{"en":"Ertona Underground Lake","ja":"エルトナ地底湖","tc":"艾爾托納地底湖","sc":"艾尔托纳地底湖"}},{"id":"skyfaring-stone-ark","name":{"en":"Skyfaring Stone Ark","ja":"空渡りの岩舟","tc":"渡空岩舟","sc":"渡空岩舟"}}],"fixed_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Squeaky","ja":"きしむ音","tc":"摩擦聲","sc":"摩擦声"},"value":10}],"random_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Glossy","ja":"つやがある","tc":"有水亮感","sc":"有水亮感"},"value":20},{"color":"blue","name":{"en":"Small Eye","ja":"目が細かい","tc":"緊密的","sc":"紧密的"},"value":15},{"color":"blue","name":{"en":"Repels Water","ja":"水を弾く","tc":"防潑水","sc":"防泼水"},"value":5}],"shopslot_set":[{"id":"lakeside-albatross","name":{"en":"Lakeside Albatross","ja":"湖上のカモメ","tc":"湖上水鷗","sc":"湖上水鸥"}},{"id":"braustbrum","name":{"en":"Braustbrum","ja":"ヴルストブルーム","tc":"香腸盛開","sc":"香肠盛开"}}],"index":36}